clrmamepro (
	name "vnovel"
	description "Visual novels (ONScripter-EN, PONScripter, KiriKiri)"
	version 2026.10.11
	author "Matcha & Nova"
	homepage "https://gitlab.com/matchaxnb/onscripter-en-libretro/blob/master/dat/vnovel.dat"
)

comment (
	The fingerprint is the game's script/data file: nscript.dat (ONScripter-EN,
	XOR 0x84), pscript.dat (PONScripter) or data.xp3 (KiriKiri), exactly as the
	core's engine detection reads it. crc/md5/sha1 are of the raw file bytes.
)

